  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of stationary wave along a stretched string is given by $y=5 \\sin \\frac{\\pi x}{3} \\cos 40 \\pi t$. Here x and y are in cm and t in second. The separation between two adjacent nodes is"
  },
  "options": [
